---
import SectionHeader from "../SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section class="bg-brand-gray py-20 text-white">
  <div class="container max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-8">
    <SectionHeader
      title="Get in on the Action"
      subtitle="Something New Every Month"
      align="center"
      subtitleClass="font-display italic text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white mt-2"
    />

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 font-light text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl text-center">
      <p>
        At MKSAA, we are never sitting still! Every Wednesday, we host a sale at our auction in Wichita, Kansas.
        Free donuts, fruit, and coffee are served all morning, and the sale begins at 9:00 AM. We also always
        have lunch on-site, whether a food truck or free lunch cooked in the lane, stick around and share a meal
        with us.
      </p>
      <p>
        Once a month, we go all out on a big promotional sale with a special theme and extra food and prizes. 
        Our promotional sales are a time for us to appreciate and celebrate with our dealers! See more about our 
        upcoming promotional sales in the list below.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
